 sky behind"},{id:"mountain",label:"山頂日出",zh:["山頂","日出","登山","雲海","山脈"],subject:["a hiker on a ridge"],setting:["mountain summit at sunrise"],extras:["sea of clouds","layered mountain ridges","golden light","rocky path"],layout:"hiker in the foreground, layered ridges and sun on the horizon"},{id:"snow",label:"雪景",zh:["雪景","雪地","下雪","滑雪"],subject:["a lone figure"],setting:["snow-covered landscape"],extras:["falling snow","frosted pine trees","footprints","soft blue light","small cabin with smoke"],layout:"figure in the foreground, cabin and trees in the middle, snowy hills behind"},{id:"moon",label:"月球／太空",zh:["月球","月亮上","登月","月面"],subject:[],setting:["lunar surface","black starry sky"],extras:["craters","a huge moon","earth in the sky","long shadows","grey regolith"],layout:"subject in the foreground on grey dust, craters in the middle, earth rising over the horizon"},{id:"space",label:"太空站／宇宙",zh:["太空","宇宙","太空站","星球","銀河","外太空"],subject:["an astronaut"],setting:["deep space"],extras:["planet","nebula","stars","space station","floating tools"],layout:"astronaut in the foreground, a large planet and nebula behind"},{id:"street",label:"城市街景",zh:["街景","街道","城市","夜景","馬路","都市"],subject:["pedestrians"],setting:["city street at night"],extras:["neon signs","reflections on wet pavement","cars with light trails","tall buildings","street lamps"],layout:"street receding to a vanishing point, buildings on both sides"},{id:"cyberpunk",label:"賽博龐克街",zh:["賽博","賽博龐克","未來都市"],subject:["a figure in a long coat"],setting:["cyberpunk megacity street"],extras:["neon holograms","rain","flying cars","giant billboards","steam vents"],layout:"figure in the foreground, glowing skyscrapers rising behind"},{id:"oldtown",label:"古城／古代市街",zh:["古城","古代","古鎮","老街","中世紀"],subject:["townspeople"],setting:["ancient walled town"],extras:["stone buildings","market carts","banners","cobblestone street","city wall"],layout:"cobblestone street in the foreground, buildings on both sides, wall behind"},{i